vider: anthropic\n  id: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\n  pinning: snapshot          # dated snapshot ID per provider model docs, checked 2026-09-15\n  adapter: none\n  max_output_tokens: 1024\n  temperature: 0.2\n\nbudgets:\n  run:\n    max_steps: 12\n    max_wall_seconds: 90\n    max_total_tokens: 60000\n    max_cost_usd: 0.40\n    max_tool_calls_per_minute: 20\n    max_subagents: 0\n  quotas:\n    - scope: user\n      window_seconds: 86400\n      max_runs: 150\n      max_tokens: 400000\n      max_cost_usd: 3.00\n    - scope: tenant\n      window_seconds: 3600\n      max_runs: 20000\n      max_tokens: 15000000\n      max_cost_usd: 250.00\n    - scope: fleet\n      window_seconds: 3600\n      max_runs: 25000\n      max_tokens: 20000000\n      max_cost_usd: 300.00\n\npricing:\n  input_per_mtok: 3.00\n  output_per_mtok: 15.00\n  cache_read_per_mtok: 0.30\n\napprovals:\n  ttl_seconds: 600\n\nstop:\n  poll_seconds: 2\n  max_stop_seconds: 10\n\nretrieval:\n  top_k: 5\n  cache_ttl_seconds: 900\n  max_chunk_chars: 4000\n\nlimits:\n  max_tool_output_bytes: 16384\n  max_user_message_chars: 4000\n\noutput:\n  allowed_link_hosts: [hr.acme.example, handbook.acme.example]\n# brace.py — the BRACE sign-off checker\n\n`brace.py` checks the supplied `.brace/` evidence record against the [BRACE checklist](../../CHECKLIST.md). High-stakes, high-autonomy or unrated deployments return **FINDINGS**, with evidence gaps and unknowns, never a BRACE GO/NO-GO deployment verdict. Lower-risk deployments retain GO/NO-GO record results. Neither a clean report nor exit code 0 authorizes deployment.\n\nAccountable people own any high-risk rollout: gradual stages, bounded exposure, close monitoring, explicit stop conditions, tested recovery and review before expansion.\nmodel:claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\nunit:src/agent.py src/agent.py\ndata:audit-log audit log","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CiDKyiGE